  unitName: Admonition Kanon
  unitId: 40534
  unitNumber: 859
  description: A disciple who once served Creator Maxwell. On top of being the silent
    type, the few utterances left by him in historical accounts are all incomprehensible
    riddles. Thanks to his constant pursuit of perfection his abilities were said
    to be equally matched to those of the Fallen Gods. However, not only did he demand
    perfection from himself, but from those around him as well. Thus it is rumored
    that when Kanon came across servants he deemed to be worthless, he would dispose
    of them mercilessly. Apparently in the midst of all this, very few others besides
    his mistress Maxwell could actually understand him.
  summonDesc: Humans have the power to summon?<br>......<br>I see now.
  fusionDesc: You're there, aren't you?<br>......<br>Understood.
